Error [jet.CalledNonFunction]: This is Int (a whole number), not a function
  --> tests/ui/call_non_function.jet:4:23
    |
  4 |     result: get_number()(1)
    |                       ^^^^^
 Why: Parentheses call functions and lambdas only
 Fix: Call a defined `fn` by name, or a function value with `(…)`
